    "summary": "Divyesh Shah is the Group CEO of Indiabulls Ltd, leading the company’s transformation into a diversified enterprise spanning real estate and digital financial services. With over two decades of experience, he focuses on building scalable, technology-driven businesses that are future-ready and create long-term stakeholder value.\n\nIn real estate, Divyesh is driving sustainable and smart urban growth through design-led residential and commercial projects located in prime, high-growth markets such as Gurgaon, Mumbai, and Ludhiana. His emphasis on smart design, efficient execution, and lasting value is shaping the next phase of urban development for the group.\n\nIn digital financial services, his vision is to empower investors through technology and data-driven innovation. By advancing solutions across NBFCs, capital markets, and asset reconstruction, he aims to make financial services simpler, more accessible, and digitally enabled for the modern investor.\n\nBeyond his professional role, Divyesh is an avid traveller, health enthusiast, and nature lover—passions that reflect his belief in continuous learning, balance, and inspired leadership.",
